# Ignored for the 1.6 release on 2026-10-08. Each entry is unreachable in this service as
# deployed; the dependency bumps follow under the dependency-update process.
#
# public-api-gateway proxies the public API behind the ingress auth service. amqp091-go talks
# to the in-cluster RabbitMQ broker only, so the TLS configuration and credential items need a
# hostile broker or configuration.

